(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 228px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Directly affects personal safety</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-anssztnilwat\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 151.008px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Property Crime</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 295.008px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Burglary, theft, vandalism</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"2\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 228px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Impacts feelings of security</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-1810s9dwsl6x\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 151.008px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Anti-Social Behavior</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 295.008px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Disorderly conduct, public disturbances</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"2\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 228px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Affects community cohesion</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">This knowledge can empower citizens to take proactive measures. Websites like <a href=\"https://www.safehomesmovement.org/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Safe Homes Movement</a> are providing insights into community safety.<br></span></p><p><b>Infrastructure and Urban Planning<br></b>Good infrastructure is crucial in ensuring safety. Well-maintained roads, adequate lighting, and accessible public spaces contribute significantly to a secure environment.</p><p><b>Role of Public Space<br></b>Public parks and community halls do not serve as recreational grounds alone. Social relationship bonding lies in them. When people enter these spaces, the social bonding they make gives the community a sense of vigilance.</p><p></p><p><b>Transportation and Accessibility<br></b>Public transports are well-organized modes of movement that allow for safe movement within the residents' locality. Well-illuminated streets and good pathways enhance safety because pedestrians can easily navigate their neighbors.</p><p><b>Maintenance and Upkeep<br></b>Infrastructure should be maintained routinely; otherwise, it becomes a breeding ground for some criminal activities in the abandoned areas. The local departments will have to take up this development work to keep such public spots safe for all concerned.<br><b>Community Engagement and Social Cohesion<br></b>Public safety can go a long way with strong communal sense. When a person knows the people around him or her, there is much likelihood that they will watch over each other.<br><b>Friendship with Neighbours<br></b>Sometimes being familiar with neighbors is like a win-win situation, even though they usually keep most of their thoughts private: offer yourself to be any resource they could use whenever they are having emergencies on their end and see who might be available to become a resource if the worst happens on yours. See if they would share your feelings sometimes.</p><p>Are there young children you should keep an eye out for? Do you live next to a senior couple that stays at home but periodically needs assistance? Does your neighbor have indoor pets, and should you call if you ever see the pets outside?<br>Planning get-togethers based on physical activity is a great way to get to know the neighbors. Plan to walk together or to have the children play outside together. Make sure all kids are at a safe distance from traffic, and teach the children safe rules for playing outside together.</p><p></p><p><b>Neighborhood Watch Programs<br></b>These programs encourage residents to be vigilant and to report suspicious activities. Research studies show that neighborhoods with active watch programs experience lower crime rates<br><b>Community Events and Activities<br></b>Event organization fosters relationships among residents. The organized block parties or clean-up drives strengthen community ties to reduce the likelihood of its occurrence.<br><b>Communication Channels Among Residents<br></b>Effective communication matters. Using social media groups or neighborhood apps, the residents can raise their issues quickly and effectively.<br><b>Environmental Design and Safety<br></b>Urban design can further influence the perception of safety in a locality. The concept of CPTED, or \"Crime Prevention Through Environmental Design,\" can be considered a broad and general concept that focuses more on changing the physical design to reduce opportunities for crime.<br><b>Eyes on the Street Concept<br></b>This concept suggests that populous places inhibit criminal activity. The higher the number of people is, the higher the chances there are of a witness to ward off the criminal.<br><b>Importance of Lighting and Visibility</b><br>Clear lighting about public areas will be key. Well-illuminated streets and parks are easier to survey and, therefore, the residents have a sense of security.<br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; vertical-align: baseline;\">Access to Essential Services</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocjy9gss4ylgqo\",\"id\":\"toc_z1l6jh92fttq\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_z1l6jh92fttq\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocjy9gss4ylgqo\",\"id\":\"toc_z1l6jh92fttq\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_z1l6jh92fttq\" style=\"\"><b>&nbsp;<br></b></span>Health, school, and emergency service readiness are some of the paramount factors to keep a neighborhood safe.</p><p></p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"2.354in\"},{\"wt\":\"4.667in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.02in\" data-table-name=\"Table_2\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-ibcvsu9ke3oi\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style